# A concise description of what this element means (e.g. for use in autogenerated summaries).
#: StructureDefinition.element.PlanDefinition.useContext:jurisdiction/short
msgid "Where the schedule applies: Uzbekistan for a national schedule, or one entry per region for a regional one"
msgstr "Jadval qayerda qo'llaniladi: milliy jadval uchun O'zbekiston, hududiy jadval uchun esa har bir viloyatga bittadan yozuv"

# Explanatory notes and implementation guidance about the data element, including notes about how to use the data properly, exceptions to proper use, etc. (Note: The text you are reading is specified in ElementDefinition.comment).
#: StructureDefinition.element.PlanDefinition.useContext:jurisdiction/comment
msgid "Region codes are the same ones used in Address.state, so a patient's region can be matched to the schedules that apply there directly."
msgstr "Viloyat kodlari Address.state da ishlatiladigan kodlar bilan bir xil, shuning uchun bemorning viloyatini u yerda amal qiluvchi jadvallar bilan to'g'ridan-to'g'ri solishtirish mumkin."

